# Float :: Int past the int64 range.
#
#   r1  x = 5.5      the control: `5.5::Int` is 5, `nonzero` fires.
#   r2  x = 1e30     past INT64_MAX: the cast traps NOT_REPRESENTABLE, the
#                    fault is recorded and `nonzero` does not fire.
#   r3  x = -1e30    the same below INT64_MIN.
#
# One fact per entity, never superseded.
assert Reading entity_id=r1 x=5.5
pump
assert Reading entity_id=r2 x=1e30
pump
assert Reading entity_id=r3 x=-1e30
pump
